WEBVTT

00:02:59.893 --> 00:03:01.976
(Music)

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:05.385
And the 11-year-old,
one impulse on the whole phrase.

00:03:05.409 --> 00:03:08.128
(Music)

00:03:08.152 --> 00:03:10.620
I don't know how
we got into this position.

00:03:10.644 --> 00:03:12.686
(Laughter)

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:15.833
I didn't say, "I'm going to move
my shoulder over, move my body."

00:03:15.857 --> 00:03:17.447
No, the music pushed me over,

00:03:17.471 --> 00:03:19.796
which is why I call it
one-buttock playing.

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:21.523
(Music)

00:03:21.547 --> 00:03:22.903
It can be the other buttock.

00:03:22.927 --> 00:03:25.904
(Music)

00:03:26.388 --> 00:03:29.872
You know, a gentleman was once
watching a presentation I was doing,

00:03:29.896 --> 00:03:31.816
when I was working with a young pianist.